## SQ-EFB-09 (earth, other grounds)
@phase long
@group B
@commands one square each in snow (`minecraft:snowy_plains`), badlands (`minecraft:badlands`), volcanic peaks (`terralith:volcanic_peaks`); `/cdevtest under` tiles
