## SQ-EFB-10 (earth, the beard band)
@group B
@commands on 3 kept villages from 02, 05 and 08: `/cdevtest count <x1> <y-8> <z1> <x2> <y-1> <z2>` for `minecraft:stone`, `minecraft:dirt`, `minecraft:sand`, the box being the start box 8 layers down from its bottom
