## SQ-EFB-11 (log vs world)
@group B
@commands for 20 kept starts across 02 to 06 with a `log = ALL` line, compare the line's `over water` and `over air after beard` numbers with the probe's columns
@pass a start logged with 0 over water has no `water-below` deeper than 2 under its earth pieces; logged 0 over air has `over6 0`; no kept start shows the probe far worse than its line (record the pairs in a table in the run doc)
@fails a systematic gap: the prediction reads `getBaseColumn` before other structures or carvers changed the ground; name the cause in TODO `structures/earthfill`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
shell n=$(grep -c '\[cdevtest\] verb=under id=' logs/latest.log); echo "under start lines this boot: $n"; [ "$n" -ge 20 ]
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/efb_judge.py vslog logs/latest.log
look RECORD the vslog pairs (start, logged over water / over air, probe water_max / over6) as a table in the run doc; a flag = the probe far worse than its line
## SQ-EFB-12 (canceled really gone)
@group B
@commands after 02 to 09: `save-all flush`; `efb_judge.py gone <level> logs/latest.log` checks every CANCELLED line's chunk in the region files (replaces `/cdevtest under <chunkX*16> <chunkZ*16> 0 <id>` per line); census `/cwglocate census 96 {PL}`
@pass no start of that id in that chunk (the slot is empty or a priority / group neighbor); the census (`/cwglocate census 96 <x> <z>`) counts the cancels as EARTH_FILL rejects
@fails a canceled start in the world: the mixin's STORE slot (index 15) missed on this path; check `ChunkGeneratorEarthFillMixin` applied at boot
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> save-all flush
sleep 10
shell L=$(grep -m1 '^level-name=' server.properties | cut -d= -f2); python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/efb_judge.py gone "$L" logs/latest.log
> cwglocate census 96 {PL1} {PL3}
waitlog \[cwglocate\] census done 1800
reject census done \(stopped\)
shell f=kubejs/exported/worldgen/locate_census.json; [ -f $f ] || f=$INST/$f; grep -oiE '"earth_fill"[^,}]*' $f | head -5; grep -qi 'earth_fill' $f
