## SQ-EFB-15 (meta parts)
@group B
@commands `/place structure creativeworldgen:meta/farmers_camp` and `meta/ruin_scatter` on a slope 40 blocks from a lake; `/cdevtest under <x> <z> 3 meta`
@pass the meta's pieces: `over6 0`, `base water 0`, `foreign: none` like single starts; dropped parts (log `dropped K of N parts`) are not in the world
@fails parts placed over water: `filterParts` judged them at the anchor's height
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> forceload add {RV1-24} {RV3-64} {RV1+104} {RV3+64}
sleep 15
> place structure creativeworldgen:meta/farmers_camp {RV1+40} 70 {RV3-20}
> place structure creativeworldgen:meta/ruin_scatter {RV1+40} 70 {RV3+30}
sleep 10
> cdevtest under {RV1+40} {RV3} 3 -
> forceload remove {RV1-24} {RV3-64} {RV1+104} {RV3+64}
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=under .*done=0
shell grep -E '\[(earth-fill|meta)\].*dropped [0-9]+ of [0-9]+ parts' logs/latest.log | tail -4 | cut -c1-300
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/efb_judge.py under logs/latest.log --box {RV1-24} {RV3-64} {RV1+104} {RV3+64} --except 'mineshaft|stronghold|ancient_city|buried_treasure|monument|shipwreck|ocean_ruin|underwater|fortress|dungeon|trial|catacomb|cave|ratatouilles|squids|mansion|balloon|sky|meteorite|ship|raft|village_ocean|outpost_ocean|wreckage|sushis|voyager' --fail over6 --fail basewater --fail foreign
look no meta part over the water (dropped parts are not in the world)
