## SQ-EFB-17 (water reach, offline)
@group none, offline
@commands `bash tools/test_worldgen_tools.sh`, EarthFillTest
@pass the new checks pass: `water reach 2 ... (x 3..12 = 10)`, `no water reach ... beard's reach 6 as before`, `water reach leaves air at the beard's reach`, `bury: water reach 2 too`, `water reach above the beard's reach is capped at it`, and the three `withBases` checks (`no base tag`, `sand base`, `stone + sand`); `ALL` for the test
@fails `EarthFill.Reach.ofWater` / `countEarth`'s water branch; `withBases` cache
@reviewed 2026-11-16
shell bash $INST/tools/test_worldgen_tools.sh > ../twt17.txt 2>&1; grep -nE "water reach|withBases|no base tag|sand base|stone \+ sand|EarthFillTest|ALL|FAIL" ../twt17.txt | head -40; ! grep -qE "FAIL|error:|Could not find or load main class" ../twt17.txt
